### Editorial defect in policy (worth flagging)

References *"ISO/IEC 27001:2022 – Annex A, Control A.5.32 (Change Management)"*. **A.5.32 does not exist in ISO 27001:2022.** Change Management is **A.8.32**. Trivial fix in the doc.

